                            <comment id="16666937" author="mmuzaf" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 09:55:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve faced with the same issue in the process of implementation&#160;the binary memory recovery.&lt;br/&gt;
The cause was incorrect assignment &lt;tt&gt;FilePageStoreManager#idxCacheStores&lt;/tt&gt; for init Metastorage in read-only mode and I had to fix it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Suppose, change &lt;tt&gt;NO_OP&lt;/tt&gt; allocator to the correct one should be enough to fix this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
